Role":"narrator-female","block":"Adjektiv-Konstruktionen: Es ist … , zu + Infinitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":3,"sub":2,"text":"Es ist schwer, Deutsch perfekt zu sprechen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Adjektiv-Konstruktionen: Es ist … , zu + Infinitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":3,"sub":3,"text":"Es ist leicht, diese Regel zu verstehen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Adjektiv-Konstruktionen: Es ist … , zu + Infinitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":3,"sub":4,"text":"Es ist sinnvoll, früh zu buchen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Adjektiv-Konstruktionen: Es ist … , zu + Infinitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":3,"sub":5,"text":"Es ist möglich, das bis Freitag zu schaffen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Adjektiv-Konstruktionen: Es ist … , zu + Infinitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":1,"text":"Ich habe Lust, ins Kino zu gehen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Nomen-Konstruktionen: Ich habe … , zu + Infinitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":2,"text":"Ich habe keine Zeit, jetzt zu telefonieren.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Nomen-Konstruktionen: Ich habe … , zu + Infinitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":3,"text":"Sie hat Angst, den Fehler zu wiederholen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Nomen-Konstruktionen: Ich habe … , zu + Infinitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":4,"text":"Wir haben die Möglichkeit, früher zu fliegen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Nomen-Konstruktionen: Ich habe … , zu + Infinitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Lena hat vor diesen Sommer an die Küste zu fahren Sie plant dort drei Wochen zu zelten und sich richtig zu erholen Es ist ihr wichtig jeden Tag im Freien zu sein und die frische Luft zu genießen Sie hat auch Lust im Meer zu schwimmen und die Aussicht auf den Himmel zu genießen Natürlich vergisst sie nicht Insektenschutz mitzubringen denn manche Insekten am Strand lästig sind Sie hofft jeden Abend am Lagerfeuer reife Trauben zu essen aber sie hat auch Angst giftige Pilze zu finden Ihre Freunde versprechen sie oft im Chat zu grüßen und ihr einen Urlaubsgruß zu schicken Am Ende beginnt sie den Alltag zu vergessen und den Moment zu genießen","authoredText":"Lena hat vor, diesen Sommer an die Küste zu fahren. Sie plant, dort drei Wochen zu zelten und sich richtig zu erholen. Es ist ihr wichtig, jeden Tag im Freien zu sein und die frische Luft zu genießen. Sie hat auch Lust, im Meer zu schwimmen und die Aussicht auf den Himmel zu genießen. Natürlich vergisst sie nicht, Insektenschutz mitzubringen, denn manche Insekten am Strand lästig sind. Sie hofft, jeden Abend am Lagerfeuer reife Trauben zu essen, aber sie hat auch Angst, giftige Pilze zu finden. Ihre Freunde versprechen, sie oft im Chat zu grüßen und ihr einen Urlaubsgruß zu schicken. Am Ende beginnt sie, den Alltag zu vergessen und den Moment zu genießen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Ferienpläne","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Renke, ehrlich — drei Wochen zelten?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ich glaube, ich würde das keinen Tag aushalten.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Genau deshalb mache ich es!","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Ich habe einfach vergessen, wie schön es ist, nichts vorzuhaben.","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Und wenn es regnet?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Dann höre ich auf zu jammern und lese ein Buch im Zelt.","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":7,"text":"Klingt das nicht wunderbar?","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":8,"text":"Ehrlich gesagt — ein bisschen schon.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L005","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Renke, ehrlich — drei Wochen zelten? Ich glaube, ich würde das keinen Tag aushalten.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Genau deshalb mache ich es! Ich habe einfach vergessen, wie schön es ist, nichts vorzuhaben.","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Und wenn es regnet?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Dann höre ich auf zu jammern und lese ein Buch im Zelt. Klingt das nicht wunderbar?","speaker":"Renke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L004","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":5,"text":"Ehrlich gesagt — ein bisschen schon.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_001_L005","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Ich habe vor, drei Wochen zu zelten und einfach zu faulenzen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Deine Freundin fragt, was du im Urlaub vorhast.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Es ist herrlich, im Freien zu schlafen und nichts vorzuhaben.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Ein Freund findet Zelten schrecklich. Sag, was daran schön ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Ich vergesse oft, mich zu erholen, weil die Arbeit nie aufhört.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Deine Kollegin fragt, warum du selten in den Urlaub fährst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Ich versuche dabei zu sein, aber ich hoffe, einen Kompromiss zu finden.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Renke fragt, ob du bei der Urlaubsplanung dabei bist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Es ist nicht nötig, Angst zu haben. Wir vergessen nur nicht, das Netz mitzunehmen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Deine Freundin hat Angst vor Insekten. Beruhige sie.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":6,"text":"Es war entspannend, im Sand zu liegen und den Himmel zu sehen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":6,"text":"Ein Freund fragt, was dein schönstes Erlebnis war.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":7,"text":"Ich habe Lust zu zelten, aber du hast vor, im Hotel zu bleiben — finden wir einen Kompromiss.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-1-infinitiv-mit-zu","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":7,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr plant den Urlaub und seid nicht einig.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":8,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":31,"vword-voice-M":31,"vword-listen":31,"example-line":13,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":7},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Erlebnisse","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":3,"w":"das","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Urlaubsplanungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":4,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Insekten","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Netze","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Chats","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":8,"w":"der","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":3,"w":"—","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Himmel","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Kompromisse","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Pilze","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Urlaubsgrüße","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Aussichten","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Küsten","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Trauben","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"